    - fixed command injection with custom link actions (#2945)
    - fixed arbitrary local file read via crafted embedded-file name (#2944)
    - reject symlinked multifile node directories + prevent cleanup from
      following symlinks (#2922, #2920)
    - reject empty tables during XML parsing (#2923)
    - on node name header, show node icon and aux icons on the left rather
      than on the right, just after last visited nodes buttons
    - improved image download on HTML paste from browser (#2925)
    - fixed crash when destroying anchored widgets (#2947)
    - support for new language Tamil
    - build with libxml++5 on windows/msys2, ubuntu 26.04+, flatpak (#2918)
  * Tests:
    - Undo/redo tests that create a text buffer directly now initialise
      gtkmm themselves instead of relying on an earlier test
    - All test apps are NON_UNIQUE, so parallel test runs no longer collide
      on the D-Bus session bus (random failures and false passes)

